{
  "_README": [
    "Points of interest, which is where residents live and work.",
    "",
    "MTResident carries HomePOI, WorkPOI, CurrentBusStop and",
    "DestinationBusStop: a resident lives at one POI, works at another, and",
    "rides between them. A zone with no POIs has nobody to put in it, which",
    "is why Arini registered as a zone and still reported 0 residents.",
    "",
    "kind maps to the vanilla blueprint: house -> POI_House_C (a home),",
    "office -> POI_Office_C (a workplace). Both are tiny actors -- a scene",
    "component, a GUID, nothing else -- and the class is the only thing that",
    "says which is which.",
    "",
    "Placed beside existing delivery points, 60 m off, because those are",
    "known-good ground with real access. Homes and workplaces alternate so",
    "residents have somewhere to commute TO, which is the whole point."
  ],
